# Google sign-in (LoginPage "Continue with Google") reuses the same Supabase
# Auth project as the phone/Google flow in apps/mobile. Two one-time setup
# steps in the Supabase Dashboard, not env vars:
#   1. Authentication -> Providers -> enable Google (with its client ID/secret).
#   2. Authentication -> URL Configuration -> Redirect URLs -> add this app's
#      origin + /auth/callback (e.g. http://localhost:5173/auth/callback for
#      local dev, plus the deployed origin).
